Disimpektahin ko ito, nakakatusok.

996
00:40:05.777 --> 00:40:07.972
(Jaeil) Ah, medyo nilalagnat ako.

997
00:40:09.310 --> 00:40:10.267
guro

998
00:40:10.334 --> 00:40:12.410
Nakuha mo ba ang mga resulta ng maternal CBC at CRP?

999
00:40:13.278 --> 00:40:14.145
(Junseok) Ah

1000
00:40:15.349 --> 00:40:17.151
Ha, hindi ko pa nagagawa yun.

1001
00:40:18.018 --> 00:40:19.024
Paano ang UA?

1002
00:40:19.711 --> 00:40:21.544
Gagawin ko rin sana iyon

1003
00:40:21.611 --> 00:40:23.710
Kasi sabi ng nanay hindi daw siya makaihi

1004
00:40:23.777 --> 00:40:24.722
hindi ko pa nagagawa

1005
00:40:24.789 --> 00:40:25.877
Ah...

1006
00:40:25.944 --> 00:40:29.627
Kaya mo ako tinatawagan kapag hindi pa tapos ang pagsubok?

1007
00:40:30.197 --> 00:40:31.609
[Awkward na tawa]
[nahihiyang paghinga]

1008
00:40:33.834 --> 00:40:35.032
Paumanhin, Guro Eom Jae-il.

1009
00:40:35.099 --> 00:40:37.367
Baka maternal test

1010
00:40:37.434 --> 00:40:39.404
Pwede mo ba akong iakyat sa delivery room at gumawa ng trabaho para sa akin?

1011
00:40:40.109 --> 00:40:41.208
(Junseok) Kapag busy tayo

1012
