Iba pang mga obstetrician at gynecologist
Sabi nila gagawin nila yun.

1013
00:40:46.680 --> 00:40:48.346
Maraming pasyente ngayon

1014
00:40:48.413 --> 00:40:49.801
Puno na itong kama ngayon

1015
00:40:49.868 --> 00:40:51.015
Hoy, tumingin ka dito.

1016
00:40:54.675 --> 00:40:55.718
(Japan) Ah!

1017
00:40:56.223 --> 00:40:57.624
Katulad din ng delivery room namin.

1018
00:40:57.691 --> 00:40:58.834
[masiglang musika]
[sigh]

1019
00:40:58.901 --> 00:41:00.391
Ang labor room ay puno na ng kama.

1020
00:41:00.458 --> 00:41:02.260
Ito ay tunay na kaguluhan.

1021
00:41:02.794 --> 00:41:04.476
(Junseok) Oh, I see.
[Buntong hininga ni Junseok]

1022
00:41:06.264 --> 00:41:08.299
Pero bakit hindi na lang minsan?

1023
00:41:08.366 --> 00:41:09.810
(Japan) Sumulat...

1024
00:41:09.877 --> 00:41:11.605
Ah...

1025
00:41:11.672 --> 00:41:12.804
Mangyayari ba ito?

1026
00:41:19.213 --> 00:41:20.478
sorry

1027
00:41:20.545 --> 00:41:21.756
Masyado kaming abala

1028
00:41:21.823 --> 00:41:23.350
[Mahinahon na musika]
(Jaeil) Mangyaring magpasuri sa ihi.

1029
00:41:23.417 --> 00:41:25.352
Mga pagsusuri sa dugo: CBC, CRP, PCT

1030
00:41:25.419 --> 00:41:26.925
Electro, OTPT, BUN

1031
00:41:26.992 --> 00:41:28.021
Bigyan mo ako ng creatinine

1032
00:41:28.088 --> 00:41:29.777
Kung masusuri mo rin si Apé Sono,

1033
00:41:29.844 --> 00:41:33.093
Ako nang mabilis at tumpak
I-upload ko ito sa nanay.

1034
00:41:33.160 --> 00:41:34.141
[walang magawang ungol ni Junseok]

1035
00:41:34.926 --> 00:41:35.827
oo

1036
00:41:36.444 --> 00:41:38.496
Pagkatapos, mangyaring makipag-ugnayan sa akin kapag natapos mo na ang inspeksyon.

1037
00:41:39.666 --> 00:41:40.721
salamat po

1038
