Nagpigil ako ng sobra

1066
00:42:48.502 --> 00:42:49.700
wala na

1067
00:42:49.767 --> 00:42:50.867
(Nanjing) Ano, ano ito?

1068
00:42:50.934 --> 00:42:53.507
Ba't biglang naging ganito kayong tatlo?
Marunong ka bang makipag-usap?

1069
00:42:53.574 --> 00:42:56.474
Ngayon, anong iisang isip! Daedong pagkakaisa!

1070
00:42:56.541 --> 00:42:57.553
Anong ginagawa mo ng ganito?

1071
00:42:58.277 --> 00:42:59.610
tama ba yun?
[Tunog ng katok]

1072
00:43:00.914 --> 00:43:02.015
(Dowon) Guys

1073
00:43:02.082 --> 00:43:03.948
Alagaan ang operability ng ina pagkatapos ng operasyon

1074
00:43:04.015 --> 00:43:05.416
MFICU ina na si Hojin Ahn

1075
00:43:05.483 --> 00:43:08.586
Kasi parang malapit na akong manganganak
Kailangan kong bantayang mabuti kung maayos ba ang contractions.

1076
00:43:09.056 --> 00:43:09.966
(magkasama) oo

1077
00:43:10.033 --> 00:43:11.333
(Jae-il) Pero hindi ka pa ba nakakaalis sa trabaho?

1078
00:43:11.400 --> 00:43:12.690
Wala bang flight bukas ng umaga?

1079
00:43:14.125 --> 00:43:16.694
Iimpake ko lang ang mga bag ko at aalis na, bye bye.

1080
00:43:18.129 --> 00:43:19.430
(Dowon) Ah, ah!

1081
00:43:20.310 --> 00:43:23.301
Tumawag kayo at sinabing, nasaan ka?

1082
00:43:23.368 --> 00:43:24.809
Excuse me, pwede ba akong magtanong?

1083
00:43:24.876 --> 00:43:25.872
Ikaw lalo na si Eom Jae-il

1084
00:43:25.939 --> 00:43:27.734
Wag na, hindi kita papayagan.

1085
00:43:27.801 --> 00:43:29.006
Ah!

1086
00:43:29.073 --> 00:43:31.150
Hindi 3 months ang bakasyon, 3 days lang?

1087
00:43:31.217 --> 00:43:32.743
Ano ang tingin mo sa amin?

1088
