(Namkyung) Ginagawa rin natin ngayon, di ba?

1089
00:43:34.915 --> 00:43:36.443
Huwag kang mag-alala

1090
00:43:36.510 --> 00:43:37.801
(Sabi) Magandang paglalakbay

1091
00:43:37.868 --> 00:43:39.350
Kailangang maliit lang ang regalo.

1092
00:43:41.367 --> 00:43:42.333
oo

1093
00:43:42.400 --> 00:43:43.343
see you next week

1094
